  "bio": {
    "zh": [
      "我是鄭凱擇，臺中科技大學資訊工程系碩士班二年級。遇到新技術時，我習慣花時間把背後的原理弄懂，**親手做過**才算真正掌握。",
      "大學期間參與工研院 TAMI 受眾分析平台，用 PySpark、Elasticsearch 與 Celery 處理大量資料，平台已上線供台灣大哥大員工使用 —— 這是我第一次體會到後端系統在真實環境中的要求。",
      "研究所後的重心是 **AI Agent 在企業裡的安全落地**：在精誠 SYSBrain 平台以 Microsoft Entra ID、OAuth 2.0 與 OpenResty 為 MCP 工具呼叫加上身分驗證，並用 NeMo Guardrails 建立四層內容防護；也參與仁寶在 COMPUTEX 2025 展出的多代理協作平台。",
      "課餘我把想法做成開源作品，也擔任 IET On Campus Taichung Tech 社群主席，一年辦了 42 場活動。我在意的不只是會用生成式 AI，而是讓 Agent **安全、可控地**運作。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "I'm Kai-Tse Cheng, a second-year M.S. student in Computer Science at National Taichung University of Science and Technology. With new technology I take the time to understand how it works underneath — I only consider something learned once I've **built it myself**.",
      "As an undergraduate I worked on ITRI's TAMI audience-analytics platform, processing large datasets with PySpark, Elasticsearch and Celery. It's in production at Taiwan Mobile, and it taught me what backend systems demand in the real world.",
      "In grad school my focus is **making AI agents safe in the enterprise**: on SYSTEX's SYSBrain platform I added authentication to MCP tool calls with Microsoft Entra ID, OAuth 2.0 and OpenResty, and built four layers of NeMo Guardrails. I also worked on Compal's multi-agent platform shown at COMPUTEX 2025.",
      "Outside of that I ship open-source side projects and chair the IET On Campus Taichung Tech community, which ran 42 events in a year. What I care about isn't just using generative AI — it's making agents run **safely and under control**."
    ]
  },
